{
    "name": "clinic-conflict-the-same-day-variant-is-a-calendar-day-not-a-time-overlap",
    "why": "clinics.session is string(2) — AM or PM — with no minutes and no session-to-minutes configuration anywhere in the schema (finding 3, open item 32), so the optional same-day variant compares CALENDAR DAYS. The duty here is an early shift ending at 14:00 and the clinic is a PM one on the same Monday: an implementation that invented session times to compare against would find no overlap and report nothing, and it would have invented them. The same world under the frozen post-call-only variant produces NOTHING — asserted in conditions.test.ts against this fixture — because an early duty's post-duty window falls on its own anchor date, which is the same-day question rather than the post-call one.",
